{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101260/extras/2229e950d1840254e6a8575d858ca5ea.avif?t=1760508268\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><strong></strong><br><strong>In the Fogreaver Demo, you\u2019ll get to play through the first three maps.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll start in <i>Base Camp</i>, your starting area, and then unlock the next two maps where you\u2019ll face both small and large hordes of zombies. On the final map, you\u2019ll even take on a powerful boss zombie!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll have access to all weapon types, but only two throwables \u2014 the Frag Grenade and the Molotov.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101260/extras/753a790268464dae25a79ba100041aa8.poster.avif?t=1760508268\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101260/extras/753a790268464dae25a79ba100041aa8.webm?t=1760508268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong>Fogreaver</strong> is an intense survival-action game set in a post-apocalyptic world overrun by zombies. As a lone survivor, you must fight through hordes of the undead, unlocking new maps as you progress. Each level challenges you to eliminate all zombies to mark the area as cleared and unlock the next battleground. <br><br>The game features a <strong>map selection system</strong>, where levels remain locked until the previous one is completed. With every successful mission, you earn progression, pushing further into the depths of the outbreak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101260/extras/b6f931e827f2cbfd935bc1e9fae509b9.poster.avif?t=1760508268\" width=1170 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101260/extras/b6f931e827f2cbfd935bc1e9fae509b9.webm?t=1760508268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for both casual and hardcore players, <strong>Fogreaver</strong> combines <strong>fast-paced combat, strategic progression, and immersive gameplay</strong>, making each fight for survival more intense than the last.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4101260?t=1760508268","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4101260?t=1760508268","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101260/17ec9c1cd5bcb72b3696ec348d6fa2af52a285dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760508268","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101260/17ec9c1cd5bcb72b3696ec348d6fa2af52a285dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760508268","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101260/extras/2229e950d1840254e6a8575d858ca5ea.avif?t=1760508268\" width=1280 height=720 /></span><strong></strong><br><strong>In the Fogreaver Demo, you\u2019ll get to play through the first three maps.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll start in <i>Base Camp</i>, your starting area, and then unlock the next two maps where you\u2019ll face both small and large hordes of zombies. On the final map, you\u2019ll even take on a powerful boss zombie!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll have access to all weapon types, but only two throwables \u2014 the Frag Grenade and the Molotov.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101260/extras/753a790268464dae25a79ba100041aa8.poster.avif?t=1760508268\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101260/extras/753a790268464dae25a79ba100041aa8.webm?t=1760508268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong>Fogreaver</strong> is an intense survival-action game set in a post-apocalyptic world overrun by zombies. As a lone survivor, you must fight through hordes of the undead, unlocking new maps as you progress. Each level challenges you to eliminate all zombies to mark the area as cleared and unlock the next battleground. <br><br>The game features a <strong>map selection system</strong>, where levels remain locked until the previous one is completed. With every successful mission, you earn progression, pushing further into the depths of the outbreak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101260/extras/b6f931e827f2cbfd935bc1e9fae509b9.poster.avif?t=1760508268\" width=1170 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4101260/extras/b6f931e827f2cbfd935bc1e9fae509b9.webm?t=1760508268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for both casual and hardcore players, <strong>Fogreaver</strong> combines <strong>fast-paced combat, strategic progression, and immersive gameplay</strong>, making each fight for survival more intense than the last.</p>","developers":["Trinnky's Studio"],"fullga